      "description": "<p>Localizado em zona residencial de <strong>Cedofeita</strong>,  o empreendimento &quot;<strong>Monte Cativo 329</strong>&quot;, &eacute; um projeto arquitet&oacute;nico composto por<strong> 10 apartamentos</strong> de tipologias<strong> T1, T2 </strong>e <strong>T3</strong>.</p><p>Apartamento moderno apresenta sala com acesso ao <strong>terra&ccedil;o</strong>, cozinha, um quarto e uma casa de banho completa. Disp&otilde;e ainda de estacionamento para 1 carro.</p><p>Os apartamentos com &aacute;reas entre os <strong>58 </strong>e os <strong>127m2</strong>, usufruem de &aacute;reas amplas e bem distribu&iacute;das, evidenciando-se os acabamentos de qualidade superior, como os pavimentos flutuantes em carvalho, as carpintarias lacadas, os tetos falsos e a pr&eacute; instala&ccedil;&atilde;o de ar condicionado, que proporcionam o m&aacute;ximo de conforto e sofistica&ccedil;&atilde;o. As <strong>cozinhas </strong>apresentam-se <strong>equipadas </strong>com eletrodom&eacute;sticos Bosch e as loi&ccedil;as sanit&aacute;rias suspensas. Beneficiam ainda de <strong>varandas </strong>ou <strong>terra&ccedil;os </strong>com <strong>granito Vila Real </strong>e acabamento bujardado.</p><p>Situado em localiza&ccedil;&atilde;o central,  pr&oacute;ximo da <strong>Pra&ccedil;a do Marqu&ecirc;s de Pombal</strong> e da <strong>Rotunda da Boavista, </strong>da <strong>Esta&ccedil;&atilde;o de Metro Carolina Michaelis</strong> e da <strong>Lapa, </strong>onde &eacute; poss&iacute;vel encontrar todo o tipo de com&eacute;rcio, servi&ccedil;os, supermercados e restaurantes.</p><p>CARACTERÍSTICAS:<br>Área: 63 m2<br>Área Útil: 63 m2<br>Quartos: 1<br>Banhos: 1<br>Garagem: 1<br>Eficiência Energética: B<br></p>DETALHES:<br><ul>\t<li>Apartamento novo</li>\t<li>Terra&ccedil;o: 7m2</li>\t<li>Garagem: 1</li></ul><p>Galardoada internacionalmente, a LUXIMOS Christie´s tem para venda mais de 1200 imóveis em Portugal (apartamentos, moradias, prédios, terrenos, etc...) e oferece um serviço de excelência na mediação imobiliária nos  mercados onde atua. Integrando a rede Christie´s International Real Estate e através dos seus seus 1350 escritórios distribuídos por 46 países presta os seus serviços aos donos de propriedades que estão a vender o seu imóvel e aos interessados nacionais e internacionais, que estão a comprar um imóvel em Portugal.</p>   <p>LIc AMI 9063</p><p>Located in the residential area of <strong>Cedofeita</strong>, the enterprise &quot;<strong>Monte Cativo 329</strong>&quot; is an architectural project composed of<strong> 10 apartments of</strong> typologies<strong> T1, T2 </strong>and <strong>T3</strong>.</p><p>Modern flat with living room with access to the <strong>terrace</strong>, kitchen, one bedroom and a complete bathroom. There is also parking for one car</p><p>The apartments, with areas between <strong>58 </strong>and <strong>127m2</strong>, are spacious and well distributed, with superior quality finishings, such as floating oak floors, lacquered carpentry, false ceilings, and pre-installation of air conditioning, which provide maximum comfort and sophistication. The <strong>kitchens </strong>are <strong>equipped </strong>with Bosch appliances and suspended sanitary ware. They also benefit from <strong>balconies </strong>or <strong>terraces </strong>with <strong>Vila Real granite </strong>and bush-hammered finishing.</p><p>Centrally located, near <strong>Pra&ccedil;a do Marqu&ecirc;s de Pombal</strong> and <strong>Rotunda da Boavista, </strong> <strong>Carolina Michaelis Metro Station</strong> and <strong>Lapa, </strong>where you can find all kinds of trade, services, supermarkets and restaurants.</p><p>CHARACTERISTICS:<br>Area: 63 m2 | 678 sq ft<br>Useful area: 63 m2 | 678 sq ft<br>Bedrooms: 1<br>Bathrooms: 1<br>Garage: 1<br>Energy efficiency: B<br></p>FEATURES:<br><ul>\t<li>New Apartment</li>\t<li>Terrace: 7m2</li>\t<li>Garage: 1</li></ul><p>Internationally awarded, LUXIMOS Christie's presents more than 1,200 properties for sale in Portugal, offering an excellent service in real estate brokerage. LUXIMOS Christie's is the exclusive affiliate of Christie´s International Real Estate (1350 offices in 46 countries) for the Algarve, Porto and North of Portugal, and provides its services to homeowners who are selling their properties, and to national and international buyers, who wish to buy real estate in Portugal.</p>   <p>Our selection includes modern and contemporary properties, near the sea or by theriver, in Foz do Douro, in Porto, Boavista, Matosinhos, Vilamoura, Tavira, Ria Formosa, Lagos, Almancil, Vale do Lobo, Quinta do Lago, near the golf courses or the marina.</p>   <p>LIc AMI 9063</p><p>Situ&eacute; dans la zone r&eacute;sidentielle de <strong>Cedofeita</strong>, l&#39;entreprise &quot;<strong>Monte Cativo 329</strong>&quot;, est un projet architectural compos&eacute; de<strong> 10 appartements</strong> de typologies<strong> T1, T2 </strong>et <strong>T3</strong>.</p><p>Appartement moderne comprenant un salon avec acc&egrave;s &agrave; la <strong>terrasse</strong>, une cuisine, une chambre et une salle de bain compl&egrave;te. Il y a &eacute;galement un parking pour une voiture.</p><p>Les appartements, d&#39;une superficie comprise entre <strong>58 </strong>et <strong>127 m2</strong>, jouissent d&#39;espaces vastes et bien distribu&eacute;s, mettant en valeur les finitions de qualit&eacute; sup&eacute;rieure, telles que les parquets en ch&ecirc;ne flottant, les menuiseries laqu&eacute;es, les faux plafonds et la pr&eacute;installation de la climatisation, qui offrent un confort et un raffinement maximum. Les <strong>cuisines </strong>sont <strong>&eacute;quip&eacute;es </strong>d&#39;appareils Bosch et de sanitaires suspendus. Ils b&eacute;n&eacute;ficient &eacute;galement de <strong>balcons </strong>ou de <strong>terrasses </strong>avec des finitions en <strong>granit Vila Real </strong>et bouchard&eacute;es.</p><p>L&#39;immeuble b&eacute;n&eacute;ficie d&#39;un emplacement central, &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la <strong>Pra&ccedil;a do Marqu&ecirc;s de Pombal</strong> et de la <strong>Rotunda da Boavista, de la </strong> <strong>station de m&eacute;tro Carolina Michaelis</strong> et de <strong>Lapa, </strong>o&ugrave; vous trouverez toutes sortes de commerces, services, supermarch&eacute;s et restaurants.</p><p>CARACTÉRISTIQUES:<br>Zone: 63 m2<br>Zone utile: 63 m2<br>Chambres: 1<br>Salles de bain: 1<br>Garage: 1<br>Efficacité énergétique: B<br></p>FONCTIONNALITÉS:<br><ul>\t<li>Appartement neuf</li>\t<li>Terrasse : 7m2</li>\t<li>Garage : 1</li></ul><p>LUXIMOS Christie’s voit le jour sur la base de cette vaste expérience, de cette tradition et de cette innovation technologique, tout en respectant les normes les plus élevées d'éthique, de discrétion, d'intégrité et de professionnalisme en contribuant à la reconnaissance et à la croissance durable de la marque, mais aussi à la satisfaction de nos clients, en trouvant les solutions immobilières possédant les caractéristiques faisant la différence qu'ils recherchent.</p>   <p>LIc AMI 9063</p>",
